:: Attack [Outcome] {"position":"500,500","size":"100,100"}
You signal your squad to attack the monster, with a loud battle scream all of you charge foward towards the monster.

With a deep roar the monster turns to look at the squad, charging at them.

Bullets fly towards the monster, piercing through it's skin, the monster uses the claws on its hand to cause wounds on your team, the monster catches one of your teammates with his huge hand and slams him into the ground, it lowers it's head to bite your teammate head off.

With all his last force your teammate grabs his combat knife and stabs the monster in the eye, the monster whines in pain and retreats, collapsing in the floor agonizing.

[[You stare at the monster]]


:: Ending {"position":"1700,700","size":"100,100"}



:: Flee [Outcome] {"position":"500,900","size":"100,100"}
[[You stare at the monster]]


:: Go inside the portal [Main-Event] {"position":"300,700","size":"100,100"}
You walk inside the portal, your team following not so far behind, the world before your eyes is full of blue plants, the sky color is a nauseaus green, this place makes you question everything you've learned about the universe.

You're taken away from your thoughts when one of your teammates points at a nearby clear.
In the middle of it you see a monster, it is sniffing around like if it was looking for something.

You have 3 options, what will you do?

[[Attack]]
[[Hide]]
[[Flee]]


:: Hide [Outcome] {"position":"500,700","size":"100,100"}
You look at the monster and decides it's to dangerous to fight it.

You signal your team to hide in some nearby bushes, waiting for the monster to eventually leave the zone.


[[You stare at the monster]]


:: Introduction {"position":"100,700","size":"100,100"}
The world has changed, after the elite of the world experimented with multiverse exploration portals have been showing up all over the world, monsters that people had nightmares with now roaming freely in our land.

You've been choosen to command a task force with other 10 strong individuals, your objective is to explore inside of these portals to find a way to stop this madness.

You and your team are equiped and ready to explore a nearby portal, the decisions you take will have consequences...

[[Go inside the portal]]


:: Kill it {"position":"900,600","size":"100,100"}

[[Move on]]


:: Leave it agonizing {"position":"900,800","size":"100,100"}
[[Move on]] 


:: Move on [Main-Event] {"position":"1100,700","size":"100,100"}



:: You stare at the monster [Main-Event] {"position":"700,700","size":"100,100"}
The tension starts to fade away, you and your team regroup to treat wounds.

The monster keeps whining in the background, slowly bleeding out, you are staring at it since the battle finished, thinking on what to do next.

Would you end its suffering and kill it in an act of mercy, or leave it to agonize until it dies?

[[Kill it]]
[[Leave it agonizing]]

